---
title: Interventional Contrasts
author:
  - name: Benjamin Vincent
description: "Draw-wise contrasts (diff, ratio, lift) vs conditional covariates, unit-level distributions, and agreement with ate() on a Bernoulli outcome."
tags:
  - Interpret
