## Contrast table

::: {#d1dbc53a .cell execution_count=5}
``` {.python .cell-code}
table_rows = []
for seg in [0.0, 1.0, 2.0]:
    for inc in [-1.0, 0.0, 1.0]:
        comp = scm.comparisons(
            "converted",
            "ad_spend",
            contrast=(0.0, 1.0),
            comparison="diff",
            conditional={"income": inc, "segment": seg},
            average_by="all",
        )
        lo, hi = comp.hdi(prob=0.94)
        table_rows.append({
            "comparison": "diff",
            "contrast": "0 vs 1",
            "income": inc,
            "segment": int(seg),
            "mean": comp.mean(),
            "hdi_low": lo,
            "hdi_high": hi,
        })

pd.DataFrame(table_rows)
```

